{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 📘 阶段 1 · DPO 家族 Loss 公式演示\n",
    "\n",
    "**目标**：用纯 PyTorch 在**合成 toy 数据**上手撕 7 个 DPO 变体的 loss，**无需任何模型下载**，\n",
    "把所有公式的差异在数值层面看清楚。\n",
    "\n",
    "**对应图中的变体** (按图从左到右、从基础到扩展)：\n",
    "\n",
    "| 变体 | 关键特点 | 论文 |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| **DPO** | 经典 baseline，sigmoid + β log-ratio | Rafailov et al., 2023 |\n",
    "| **IPO** | 平方损失，避免 DPO 过拟合 | Azar et al., 2023 |\n",
    "| **CPO** | DPO 偏好项 + SFT NLL 项 | Xu et al., 2024 |\n",
    "| **KTO** | Kahneman-Tversky 效用，**不需要成对数据** | Ethayarajh et al., 2024 |\n",
    "| **ORPO** | Odds Ratio + SFT，**不需要 reference model** | Hong et al., 2024 |\n",
    "| **SimPO** | 长度归一 + 无 reference | Meng et al., 2024 |\n",
    "| **SIPO** | 在 log-ratio 上加统计信息修正 | Wei et al., 2024 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys, os\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, os.path.abspath('../common'))  # 让 common/dpo_losses.py 可被 import\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "from dpo_losses import LOSS_REGISTRY\n",
    "print('Available losses:', list(LOSS_REGISTRY.keys()))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1.1 准备合成数据\n",
    "\n",
    "我们手工指定 4 个样本，每个样本的 (chosen, rejected) 是**成对**的偏好。\n",
    "\n",
    "在真实训练里，这些值来自：\n",
    "- `chosen_logprob` = 当前策略模型对 chosen 回答的 sum log p(y|x) / len\n",
    "- `ref_chosen_logprob` = 参考策略模型 (SFT 后的) 对 chosen 回答的 sum log p\n",
    "\n",
    "这里我们让 chosen 的 log prob 整体高于 rejected 来模拟"学习进展良好"的状态。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "torch.manual_seed(42)\n",
    "B = 4\n",
    "# 真实数据中: chosen 比 rejected 概率高 (因为是“人类偏好的”)；ref 也是 chosen>rejected\n",
    "chosen_logprob       = torch.tensor([-1.0, -1.2, -0.8, -1.5])\n",
    "rejected_logprob     = torch.tensor([-2.5, -3.0, -2.2, -2.8])\n",
    "ref_chosen_logprob   = torch.tensor([-1.3, -1.4, -1.0, -1.7])\n",
    "ref_rejected_logprob = torch.tensor([-2.4, -2.9, -2.1, -2.7])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== 样本对照 (值越大表示模型给该回答的 log 概率越高) ===\")\n",
    "for i in range(B):\n",
    "    print(f\"  sample {i}: chosen={chosen_logprob[i]:.2f}  rejected={rejected_logprob[i]:.2f}  \"\n",
    "          f\"Δ_policy={chosen_logprob[i]-rejected_logprob[i]:.2f}  Δ_ref={ref_chosen_logprob[i]-ref_rejected_logprob[i]:.2f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 怎么看这些数字？\n",
    "- **Δ_policy** 是当前策略的 chosen-rejected log prob 差，训练目标是让它**变大**\n",
    "- **Δ_ref** 是参考策略的差值（frozen），DPO 的核心思想是：\n",
    "  > \"让策略的 Δ 变得**比 ref 的 Δ 更大**，相当于在 ref 的基础上额外提升 chosen 的相对偏好\"\n",
    "\n",
    "当 Δ_policy 远大于 Δ_ref 时，隐式奖励 r=β·(Δ_policy-Δ_ref) 会很大，sigmoid 接近 1，loss→0。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "## 1.2 跑一遍所有 7 个 loss\n",
    "print(f\"{'variant':<8} | {'loss':>8} | {'logit':>10} | {'interpretation'}\")\n",
    "print('-' * 80)\n",
    "\n",
    "beta = 0.1\n",
    "for name in ['dpo', 'ipo', 'cpo', 'kto', 'orpo', 'simpo', 'sipo']:\n",
    "    fn = LOSS_REGISTRY[name]\n",
    "    if name == 'dpo':\n",
    "        # 计算内部 logit 用来观察\n",
    "        logits = beta * ((chosen_logprob - rejected_logprob) - (ref_chosen_logprob - ref_rejected_logprob))\n",
    "        v = fn(chosen_logprob, rejected_logprob, ref_chosen_logprob, ref_rejected_logprob, beta=beta)\n",
    "        print(f\"{name:<8} | {v.item():>8.4f} | {logits.mean().item():>10.4f} | sigmoid 越大 -> loss 越小\")\n",
    "    elif name == 'ipo':\n",
    "        logits = (chosen_logprob - rejected_logprob) - (ref_chosen_logprob - ref_rejected_logprob)\n",
    "        v = fn(chosen_logprob, rejected_logprob, ref_chosen_logprob, ref_rejected_logprob, beta=beta)\n",
    "        print(f\"{name:<8} | {v.item():>8.4f} | {logits.mean().item():>10.4f} | 平方损失,目标让logit→1/(2β)\")\n",
    "    elif name == 'cpo':\n",
    "        v = fn(chosen_logprob, rejected_logprob, ref_chosen_logprob, ref_rejected_logprob,\n",
    "               chosen_logprob/50, rejected_logprob/50, beta=beta, alpha=0.1)\n",
    "        print(f\"{name:<8} | {v.item():>8.4f} | {'-':>10} | DPO 偏好项 + 0.1×SFT项\")\n",
    "    elif name == 'kto':\n",
    "        v = fn(chosen_logprob, rejected_logprob, ref_chosen_logprob, ref_rejected_logprob, beta=beta)\n",
    "        print(f\"{name:<8} | {v.item():>8.4f} | {'-':>10} | 非成对,Kahneman-Tversky 效用\")\n",
    "    elif name == 'orpo':\n",
    "        v = fn(chosen_logprob, rejected_logprob, chosen_logprob/50, rejected_logprob/50, beta=beta)\n",
    "        print(f\"{name:<8} | {v.item():>8.4f} | {'-':>10} | Odds Ratio + SFT,无需 ref\")\n",
    "    elif name == 'simpo':\n",
    "        v = fn(chosen_logprob/50, rejected_logprob/50, beta=2.0, gamma_beta_ratio=0.5)\n",
    "        print(f\"{name:<8} | {v.item():>8.4f} | {'-':>10} | length-norm + 正 margin γ\")\n",
    "    elif name == 'sipo':\n",
    "        v = fn(chosen_logprob, rejected_logprob, ref_chosen_logprob, ref_rejected_logprob, beta=beta, alpha=0.5)\n",
    "        print(f\"{name:<8} | {v.item():>8.4f} | {'-':>10} | DPO + 统计信息修正\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1.3 关键超参数的影响 — β 扫描\n",
    "\n",
    "**β 是 DPO 家族中最重要的超参数之一**，它控制隐式奖励的\"温度\"。\n",
    "- β 太大 → 隐式奖励尖锐，训练不稳定\n",
    "- β 太小 → 隐式奖励过于平滑，policy 几乎不变\n",
    "\n",
    "我们用 DPO loss 做 β 扫描，看 loss 怎么随 β 变化。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "betas = np.linspace(0.01, 1.0, 50)\n",
    "losses = []\n",
    "for b in betas:\n",
    "    l = LOSS_REGISTRY['dpo'](chosen_logprob, rejected_logprob, ref_chosen_logprob, ref_rejected_logprob, beta=float(b))\n",
    "    losses.append(l.item())\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(6,3.5))\n",
    "plt.plot(betas, losses, label='DPO loss')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('beta'); plt.ylabel('loss'); plt.title('DPO loss vs beta (toy data)')\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3); plt.legend(); plt.tight_layout(); plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1.4 验证 DPO 训练目标：\"拉大 chosen-rejected 差距\"\n",
    "\n",
    "我们手动\"模拟训练一步\"，看 loss 下降时 Δ_policy 怎么变化。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 把 chosen_logprob / rejected_logprob 当作可训练变量 (用 torch.tensor + requires_grad)\n",
    "clp = chosen_logprob.clone().detach().requires_grad_(True)\n",
    "rlp = rejected_logprob.clone().detach().requires_grad_(True)\n",
    "ref_clp = ref_chosen_logprob.clone().detach()  # ref frozen\n",
    "ref_rlp = ref_rejected_logprob.clone().detach()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"{'step':<5} | {'loss':>8} | {'Δ_policy':>10} | {'Δ_ref':>8}\")\n",
    "print('-' * 45)\n",
    "for step in range(15):\n",
    "    loss = LOSS_REGISTRY['dpo'](clp, rlp, ref_clp, ref_rlp, beta=0.5)\n",
    "    loss.backward()\n",
    "    with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "        clp -= 0.1 * clp.grad\n",
    "        rlp -= 0.1 * rlp.grad\n",
    "        clp.grad.zero_(); rlp.grad.zero_()\n",
    "    delta_pi = (clp - rlp).mean().item()\n",
    "    delta_ref = (ref_clp - ref_rlp).mean().item()\n",
    "    print(f\"{step:<5} | {loss.item():>8.4f} | {delta_pi:>10.4f} | {delta_ref:>8.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "🎯 **看到了吗？** loss 在单调下降，Δ_policy 在**逐渐拉开**与 Δ_ref 的差距。\n",
    "\n",
    "这就是 DPO 的核心机制 —— 它**没有显式的 reward model**，但通过 log-ratio 差，\n",
    "等效于在最大化一个隐式奖励 `r(x,y) = β·(log p_θ(y|x) - log p_ref(y|x))`。\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ 阶段 1 完成！下一步进入 **阶段 2：用真实小模型 + UltraFeedback 端到端跑 DPO**。"
   ]
  }
 ],
